  "title": "Warm Lentil Salad",
  "subtitle": "French green lentils with chorizo and a sharp mustard dressing",
  "excerpt": "Green lentils hold their shape better than red and make an excellent base for a warm salad. Sliced chorizo fried crisp gives pops of smoky richness throughout, and a Dijon vinaigrette ties the whole thing together.",
